WEBVTT

00:00:00.102 --> 00:00:04.744
Here is what we are going to learn in this module
First

00:00:04.937 --> 00:00:10.420
we will combine conditions using AND OR and NOT Next
we will

00:00:10.446 --> 00:00:16.028
discuss three-valued logic This is important because
SQL conditions can evaluate to

00:00:16.041 --> 00:00:21.152
TRUE FALSE or UNKNOWN Then we will work with missing
values and

00:00:21.178 --> 00:00:25.806
learn why null needs special treatment We will also
use case expressions

00:00:25.832 --> 00:00:31.723
to convert business rules into categories and labels
Finally we will combine

00:00:31.748 --> 00:00:36.634
these ideas in realistic examples and exercises As
you work through the

00:00:36.647 --> 00:00:41.840
module focus on understanding what each condition
means If you can explain

00:00:41.866 --> 00:00:45.874
the logic clearly in plain language writing the SQL
becomes much easier
